OL,3,CThames Water says nine in 10 people
OL,4,Cback plans for Abingdon Reservoir
OL,6,FAlmost nine in ten people back plans
OL,7,Ffor a huge reservoir 'the size of
OL,8,FGatwick Airport', according to
OL,9,Fresearch by Thames Water.
OL,11,FThe supplier says the proposed White
OL,12,FHorse Reservoir would secure water
OL,13,Fsupply for 15 million people across
OL,14,Fthe south east, including Thames
OL,15,FWater, Affinity Water and Southern
OL,16,FWater customers.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
