OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786537136
OL,3,CThames Water says nine in 10 people
OL,4,Cback plans for Abingdon Reservoir
OL,6,FAccording to new research two thirds
OL,7,Fof people are worried about having
OL,8,Faccess to a consistent supply of water
OL,9,Fand less than a third believe there
OL,10,Fwill always be a plentiful supply of
OL,11,Fwater in the region, as Britain
OL,12,Fendures its fifth heatwave of the year.
OL,14,FThere has been no rainfall during July
OL,15,Fin the Thames Catchment, with Thames
OL,16,FWater warning of a 1 billion litre
OL,17,Fdaily shortfall of water by 2050
OL,18,Fwithout "urgent action".
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
