OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786537136
OL,3,CThames Water says nine in 10 people
OL,4,Cback plans for Abingdon Reservoir
OL,6,FLeonie Dubois, Delivery Director,
OL,7,FConsents and Place, Thames Water said:
OL,8,F"This summer has served as a stark
OL,9,Freminder of the extremely hot and dry
OL,10,Fweather that is set to become our new
OL,11,Fnorm.
OL,13,F"It's therefore vital that we're able
OL,14,Fto store more water and White Horse
OL,15,FReservoir's role in future water
OL,16,Fsupply is of national critical
OL,17,Fimportance.
OL,19,F"It's incredibly encouraging to see
OL,20,Fpeople backing our plans and wanting
OL,21,Fto see the reservoir become reality.
OL,26,@pD@AOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
