CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786537136
OL,3,CThames Water says nine in 10 people
OL,4,Cback plans for Abingdon Reservoir
OL,6,F"The project would secure water supply
OL,7,Ffor millions right across the South
OL,8,FEast, protecting our customers and the
OL,9,Fenvironment."
OL,11,FIn January three Oxfordshire MPs
OL,12,Fraised concerns over the estimated
OL,13,Fcost of building a new reservoir.
OL,15,FThe price tag for the project ` known
OL,16,Fas South East Strategic Reservoir
OL,17,FOption ` has increased from #2.2bn to
OL,18,Fup to #6.6bn.
OL,26,@qD@MO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
