OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1786537136
OL,3,CThames Water says nine in 10 people
OL,4,Cback plans for Abingdon Reservoir
OL,6,FLiberal Democrats Olly Glover, Layla
OL,7,FMoran and Charlie Maynard argue the
OL,8,Frising price tag "significantly
OL,9,Fundermines the business case and risks
OL,10,Fleaving bill payers liable".
OL,12,FBut Thames Water forecasts the
OL,13,Freservoir would create more than 1,000
OL,14,Fnew jobs during its construction and
OL,15,F84 per cent of those surveyed say
OL,16,Fit'll boost jobs and the economy.
OL,18,FIts research also revealed eight in 10
OL,19,Fpeople across the South East would
OL,20,Fvisit the new reservoir, cooling off
OL,21,Fand connecting with nature.
OL,26,@pD@ROUrD@[O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
