OL,3,CThames Water says nine in 10 people
OL,4,Cback plans for Abingdon Reservoir
OL,6,FThe company says it is on track to
OL,7,Fsubmit its Development Consent Order
OL,8,Fapplication to the planning
OL,9,Finspectorate in November 2026.
OL,11,FThe proposed reservoir would be
OL,12,Favailable for use from 2040.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
